ll}, {"id": "docs_arch_technical_specs_student_profile_route", "label": "/student/:studentId route uses human-readable student_id", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ARCH_technical-specs.md", "source_location": "L285", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Param name misleading: it is PsychE_Students.student_id, not UUID; passing a UUID renders Student not found."}, {"id": "docs_arch_technical_specs_capacity_enforcement", "label": "V2 Capacity Enforcement (daily_session_capacity)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ARCH_technical-specs.md", "source_location": "L303", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_arch_technical_specs_overdue_detection", "label": "Overdue Detection at Query Time", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ARCH_technical-specs.md", "source_location": "L312", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Overdue derived at query time (scheduled_date < today and still Scheduled) so no background job is needed."}, {"id": "docs_arch_technical_specs_bulk_auto_scheduler", "label": "Bulk Auto-Scheduler Greedy Algorithm", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ARCH_technical-specs.md", "source_location": "L319", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_arch_technical_specs_assessment_cooldown", "label": "Assessment Cooldown", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ARCH_technical-specs.md", "source_location": "L326", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_arch_technical_specs_tag_assignment", "label": "Tag Assignment ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ARCH_technical-specs.md", "source_location": "L351", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_arch_technical_specs_domain_scoring_engine", "label": "Domain Scoring Engine (calculate_student_telemetry, V6)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ARCH_technical-specs.md", "source_location": "L368", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Second-order hierarchical factor model (item->module->domain) designed with an external psychometrics consultant; per-module means remove V5.0 item-count bias; per-module scale_min/max normalization makes it instrument-agnostic; unadministered modules excised via lambda rather than treated as zero."}, {"id": "docs_arch_technical_specs_hierarchical_factor_model", "label": "Second-Order Hierarchical Factor Model", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ARCH_technical-specs.md", "source_location": "L370", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_arch_technical_specs_min_max_normalization", "label": "Per-Module Min-Max Normalization (Z_m)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ARCH_technical-specs.md", "source_location": "L376", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_arch_technical_specs_availability_coefficient_lambda", "label": "Availability Coefficient (lambda) Missing-Data Excision", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ARCH_technical-specs.md", "source_location": "L380", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Missing data is never faked: unmeasured components are excised from numerator and denominator, and all-missing yields NULL rather than a default."}, {"id": "docs_arch_technical_specs_direction_convention", "label": "Distress vs Wellness Direction Convention", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ARCH_technical-specs.md", "source_location": "L223", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "composite_score is distress-direction while domain_scores and rsi_score are wellness-direction; domain D_k inverted once at storage (1 - D_k) so frontend storage contract stays unchanged."}, {"id": "docs_arch_technical_specs_archetype", "label": "Archetype Classification", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ARCH_technical-specs.md", "source_location": "L389", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_arch_technical_specs_tension_matrix", "label": "Tension Matrix (Cross-Domain Tension, 4 axes + dominant_tension)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ARCH_technical-specs.md", "source_location": "L391", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Bifactor-residual approximation: divergent profiles (e.g. masking: high COG, low EMH) are more diagnostic than uniformly low ones; sign carries clinical meaning; V5.0 T_internal_external average removed because it destroyed divergence information."}, {"id": "docs_arch_technical_specs_cold_start_gatekeeper", "label": "Cold-Start Gatekeeper (psyche_get_engine_status)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ARCH_technical-specs.md", "source_location": "L402", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_arch_technical_specs_confidence_multiplier", "label": "calculateConfidenceMultiplier frontend display ramp", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ARCH_technical-specs.md", "source_location": "L413", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_arch_technical_specs_eti_engine", "label": "ETI Engine - Engagement Trajectory Index (psyche_calculate_eti)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ARCH_technical-specs.md", "source_location": "L415", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_arch_technical_specs_avoidance_flag", "label": "Avoidance Flag (chronic no-show)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ARCH_technical-specs.md", "source_location": "L421", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_arch_technical_specs_daily_batch", "label": "Daily Batch psyche_run_daily_batch (two-pass)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ARCH_technical-specs.md", "source_location": "L424", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pass 1 per-student (gatekeeper, ETI, composite) then Pass 2 RSI ranking; both in one transaction so Pass 2 sees all Pass 1 writes."}, {"id": "docs_arch_technical_specs_daily_analytics_cron", "label": "GitHub Actions daily_analytics.yml cron (21:30 UTC)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ARCH_technical-specs.md", "source_location": "L366", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_arch_technical_specs_cross_engine_upsert_fix", "label": "Cross-Engine Upsert Carry-Forward Fix (V6.1)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ARCH_technical-specs.md", "source_location": "L433", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "INSERT branches originally set only own columns, nulling the other engine's data on new day rows; fix carries forward last-known values from most recent prior row."}, {"id": "docs_arch_technical_specs_composite_score", "label": "Composite Score (psyche_compute_composite_score, V7)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ARCH_technical-specs.md", "source_location": "L438", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Strictly self-contained, criterion-referenced per student; Relative Deficit term removed to break circular dependency with RSI. Weights 0.44/0.28/0.17/0.11 are provisional consultant judgment."}, {"id": "docs_arch_technical_specs_evidential_floor", "label": "Evidential Floor CF_C >= 0.5 (V7.1 confidence gating)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ARCH_technical-specs.md", "source_location": "L457", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "V7.0 assumption that C=NULL only at cold_start was false: ETI-only students produced High Load false positives. Gate presentation and RSI eligibility on confidence, not on the formula; scores still stored."}, {"id": "docs_arch_technical_specs_rsi", "label": "RSI - Relative Scoring Index (psyche_compute_rsi_for_student)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ARCH_technical-specs.md", "source_location": "L467", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Only norm-referenced metric; cohort fallback course->grade->school with n>=8 floor because small cohorts give coarse/outlier-dominated percentiles; must never be read without Composite Score."}, {"id": "docs_arch_technical_specs_cohort_fallback_chain", "label": "Cohort Fallback Chain (n >= 8)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ARCH_technical-specs.md", "source_location": "L473", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_arch_technical_specs_circular_dependency_resolution", "label": "Composite-RSI Circular Dependency Resolution", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ARCH_technical-specs.md", "source_location": "L440", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_arch_technical_specs_programme_health", "label": "V8 Programme Health (psyche_programme_health)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ARCH_technical-specs.md", "source_location": "L489", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Built for a single-counsellor school; per-counsellor comparison meaningless and capacity cannot grow, so the question is allocation."}, {"id": "docs_arch_technical_specs_measured_modelled_split", "label": "Measured / Modelled Split", "file_type": "rationale", "